; xfail: xfail_submodule_helper.scaly:11:11: expected '}'
;
; A parse error in a loaded sub-module must surface against the SUB-MODULE's
; own file:line:col (since 2026-09-24 the line of the token the parse stopped
; at, 11:11, not the brace the body opened with), not be swallowed into an empty stub (which used to make
; the real error vanish and re-appear as a misleading planner "not found" in
; the wrong file). Modeler.build_referenced_module now reports the real error
; and bumps modeler_error_count; cli.run fails the compile (rc 2) via
; Modeler.had_errors() before the planner runs. The sidecar
; xfail_submodule_helper.scaly holds the broken body.

module xfail_submodule_helper

function main() returns int
{
    return helper()
}
